<mxCell id="53" value="&lt;b&gt;Cardinality:&lt;/b&gt; users 1—N projectMembers N—1 projects 1—N tickets. Member remove / role change away from member is blocked (409 MEMBER_HAS_OPEN_TICKETS) while they hold open assigned tickets, unless reassigned in the same request. Disabled users keep assignments until someone reassigns. Ticket IDs use atomic $inc on project.ticketSeq." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
